<urn:usf:rule:cli-inventory-denominator:1> <urn:usf:predicate:text> "Read the actual installed registry, canonical parser contracts and dispatcher ownership in one immutable source snapshot. Enumerate exact token paths, preserving token order, default-command behavior and parser-defined modes. A prefix alone does not establish group-only. Missing parser coverage, unsupported dynamic dispatch, missing source, changed source or incomplete enumeration keeps INVENTORY_INCOMPLETE. Bound at 1024 paths, 16 tokens per path and 4096 characters per path; refuse overflow without truncation. Canonical digest binds every source identity and exact path array. The retained 78-path observation is not a hardcoded denominator." <urn:usf:graph:cli-inventory> .
