<urn:usf:rule:cli-inventory-acceptance:1> <urn:usf:predicate:text> "Tests use self-contained typed graph and installed registry/parser snapshots, not ignored runtime helpers. Assert bijection, default-command versus group distinctions, duplicate/orphan/unknown class, mixed object kinds, wrong owner, unmapped transition, missing required Linear/Hermes ownership, invalid exclusion, stale parser/module/basis, incomplete enumeration and bounds. Seed each of the four classes with genuine class evidence; mutate each evidence edge to retain a defect. Assert deterministic reorder behavior, source digest sensitivity, aggregate inventory diagnostic emitted once, unrelated evaluator/recovery/parallel/terminal families preserved, and no effects." <urn:usf:graph:cli-inventory> .
